{"seq":9,"slug":"cloud-native-security","title":"云原生安全","stage":"DONE","category":"cybersecurity-applied","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 云原生安全\n\n云原生安全是网络安全实践体系中面向云计算与容器化基础设施的专门领域，它研究在公有云、私有云和混合云环境中保护应用、数据和基础设施的方法论与技术方案。随着全球企业云采用率在 2025 年突破 94%、容器化部署占生产工作负载的比例超过 75%，云原生环境已成为网络攻击的首要目标——仅 2025 年上半年，针对云基础设施的攻击就同比增长了 48%，其中错误配置导致的数据泄露事件造成的平均损失高达 445 万美元（IBM 数据泄露成本报告 2025）。\n\n本 hub 系统讲解云原生安全的四大核心支柱：云安全基础模型与零信任架构、容器与 Kubernetes 编排安全、云原生应用与数据保护、以及安全运营与合规自动化。内容面向 3-7 年经验的安全工程师、DevOps 从业者和云架构师，注重可落地的技术方案与工程实践，而非抽象的合规条文堆砌。\n\n**与兄弟 hub 的分工边界：** 本 hub 聚焦云原生环境特有的安全问题——共享责任模型、容器编排安全、服务网格 mTLS、云密钥管理、CSPM 等。传统网络边界防御（防火墙、IDS/IPS）见 [网络安全防御](../5_network-security/_INTRODUCTION.md)；应用层漏洞与 OWASP Top 10 见 [应用安全工程](../6_application-security/_INTRODUCTION.md)；密码学数学基础与协议见 [应用密码学](../8_applied-cryptography/_INTRODUCTION.md)；软件供应链安全（SLSA、依赖混淆）见 [软件供应链安全](../7_software-supply-chain-security/_INTRODUCTION.md)。本 hub 在涉及这些领域时仅做必要的上下文铺垫，不重复展开。\n\n**推荐学习路径：** 初学者按章节顺序阅读——先建立云安全模型与零信任的概念框架（第一章），再深入容器与 K8s 的具体防护技术（第二章），然后掌握应用与数据保护的工程实践（第三章），最后理解安全运营与合规的持续保障机制（第四章）。有 K8s 运维经验的读者可从第二章切入，遇到模型层面的疑问再回查第一章。\n\n**前置知识：** 熟悉云计算基本概念（IaaS/PaaS/SaaS）、了解 Linux 容器原理、具备基础的网络知识（TCP/IP、TLS）。密码学相关内容引用自应用密码学 hub，读者无需预先掌握密码学数学基础。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cloud-security-foundations","title":"云安全基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/cloud-security-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cloud-security-model","title":"云安全模型与责任","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/cloud-security-foundations/cloud-security-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cloud-native-threat-modeling","title":"云原生威胁模型","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/cloud-security-foundations/cloud-native-threat-modeling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"zero-trust-architecture","title":"零信任架构","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/cloud-security-foundations/zero-trust-architecture"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"container-orchestration","title":"容器与编排安全","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/container-orchestration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"container-image-security","title":"容器镜像安全","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/container-orchestration/container-image-security"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kubernetes-security","title":"Kubernetes安全","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/container-orchestration/kubernetes-security"},{"seq":3,"slug":"service-mesh-security","title":"服务网格安全","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/container-orchestration/service-mesh-security"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"application-data","title":"应用与数据","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/application-data","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cloud-native-app-security","title":"云原生应用安全","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/application-data/cloud-native-app-security"},{"seq":2,"slug":"secrets-management","title":"密钥与机密管理","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/application-data/secrets-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-encryption-privacy","title":"数据加密与隐私","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/application-data/data-encryption-privacy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations-compliance","title":"运营与合规","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/operations-compliance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cspm","title":"云安全态势管理","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/operations-compliance/cspm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"detection-response","title":"入侵检测与响应","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/operations-compliance/detection-response"},{"seq":3,"slug":"compliance-audit","title":"合规与审计","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/operations-compliance/compliance-audit"}]}]}